//! tr kodlu 1
// Error 09 — Unknown named argument.
// Message code: H2410
// What happens: If a call uses a parameter name the function does not take, an error is raised at run time.
// Why: greet() takes a parameter called who; 'name' was written.
// Fixed version:
//     print(greet(who: "Ali"))
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/09_unknown_named_argument.tr   (exit code 1)

A020 greet(who) {
    A021 "Hi {who}"
}
G100(greet(name: "Ali"))
